(393, 1, '2022-01-04 07:02:06', '2022-01-04 07:02:06', 'It is generally believed that when hundreds of sheep were disappeared from the place where the temple stands today, the shepherds prayed to get their sheep back. Surprisingly they had a vision of the Devi herself who asked them to sacrifice a few of the sheep to get back their lost ones. It is said that when they sacrificed the demanded sheep as they were asked by the Devi, the lost sheep were found, and from then onwards people started to worship Pathibhara Devi.\r\n\r\nIt is generally believed that when hundreds of sheep were disappeared from the place where the temple stands today, the shepherds prayed to get their sheep back. Surprisingly they had a vision of the Devi herself who asked them to sacrifice a few of the sheep to get back their lost ones. It is said that when they sacrificed the demanded sheep as they were asked by the Devi, the lost sheep were found, and from then onwards people started to worship Pathibhara Devi.', 'France Tour Package', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'france-tour-package', '', '', '2022-01-04 07:02:06', '2022-01-04 07:02:06', '', 0, 'http://localhost/aa/tour/france-tour-package/', 0, 'tour', '', 0),
