(2819, 1, '2019-09-28 10:25:04', '2019-09-28 10:25:04', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below is an example of a <strong>Slideshow Block</strong> which is included in the free Jetpack Plugin. See more details about this block <a href=\"https://jetpack.com/support/jetpack-blocks/slideshow-block/\">here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/slideshow {\"align\":\"wide\",\"ids\":[5828,5829,5830,5831,5832,5833],\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow alignwide\" data-effect=\"slide\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper-container\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrapper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5828\" data-id=\"5828\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/syd-sujuaan-293256-unsplash.jpg\"></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5829\" data-id=\"5829\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/tom-mussak-108420-unsplash.jpg\"></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5830\" data-id=\"5830\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/annie-spratt-173413-unsplash.jpg\"></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5831\" data-id=\"5831\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/ishan-seefromthesky-179744-unsplash.jpg\"></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5832\" data-id=\"5832\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/clem-onojeghuo-111588-unsplash.jpg\"></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-5833\" data-id=\"5833\" src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/fidelia-zheng-106777-unsplash.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_caption gallery-caption\">Full-width image</figcaption></figure></li></ul><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-prev swiper-button-prev swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-next swiper-button-next swiper-button-white\" role=\"button\"></a><a aria-label=\"Pause Slideshow\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_button-pause\" role=\"button\"></a><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_pagination swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-white\"></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/slideshow -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is some dummy copy. You’re not really supposed to read this dummy copy, it is just a place holder for people who need some type to visualize what the actual copy might look like if it were real content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to read, I might suggest a good book, perhaps <a title=\"Hemingway\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernest_Hemingway\">Hemingway</a> or <a title=\"Melville\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herman_Melville\">Melville</a>. That’s why they call it, the dummy copy. This, of course, is not the real copy for this entry. Rest assured, the words will expand the concept. With clarity. Conviction. And a little wit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Post with Slideshow', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'post-with-slideshow', '', '', '2023-03-18 13:25:24', '2023-03-18 18:25:24', '', 0, 'http://demo.wpzoom.com/delirium/?p=2819', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(2831, 1, '2019-10-31 10:28:29', '2019-10-31 10:28:29', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is some dummy copy. You’re not really supposed to read this dummy copy, it is just a place holder for people who need some type to visualize what the actual copy might look like if it were real content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Mosaic Gallery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"ids\":[5836,5835,5834,5833,5832,5831,5830,5828],\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"post\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/caleb-george-316073-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5836\" class=\"wp-image-5836\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/andreas-gucklhorn-285567-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5835\" class=\"wp-image-5835\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/nathan-anderson-316188-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5834\" class=\"wp-image-5834\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/fidelia-zheng-106777-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5833\" class=\"wp-image-5833\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/clem-onojeghuo-111588-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5832\" class=\"wp-image-5832\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/ishan-seefromthesky-179744-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5831\" class=\"wp-image-5831\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/annie-spratt-173413-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5830\" class=\"wp-image-5830\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/syd-sujuaan-293256-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5828\" class=\"wp-image-5828\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to read, I might suggest a good book, perhaps <a title=\"Hemingway\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernest_Hemingway\">Hemingway</a> or <a title=\"Melville\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herman_Melville\">Melville</a>. That’s why they call it, the dummy copy. This, of course, is not the real copy for this entry. Rest assured, the words will expand the concept. With clarity. Conviction. And a little wit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Square Tiles</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"ids\":[5836,5828,5829,5834,5832],\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"post\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/caleb-george-316073-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5836\" class=\"wp-image-5836\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/syd-sujuaan-293256-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5828\" class=\"wp-image-5828\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/tom-mussak-108420-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5829\" class=\"wp-image-5829\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/nathan-anderson-316188-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5834\" class=\"wp-image-5834\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/clem-onojeghuo-111588-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5832\" class=\"wp-image-5832\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s competitive <a title=\"market environment\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Market_environment\">market environment</a>, the body copy of your entry must lead the reader through a series of <strong>disarmingly simple thoughts</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5830} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/annie-spratt-173413-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5830\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5831} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/ishan-seefromthesky-179744-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5831\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5833,\"className\":\"size-full wp-image-5833\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image size-full wp-image-5833\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/fidelia-zheng-106777-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5833\"/><figcaption>Full-width image</figcaption></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', 'Post with Gallery', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'post-with-gallery', '', '', '2023-03-18 13:25:24', '2023-03-18 18:25:24', '', 0, 'http://demo.wpzoom.com/delirium/?p=2831', 0, 'post', '', 0),
