/08/annie-spratt-173413-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5830\" class=\"wp-image-5830\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/syd-sujuaan-293256-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5828\" class=\"wp-image-5828\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to read, I might suggest a good book, perhaps <a title=\"Hemingway\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernest_Hemingway\">Hemingway</a> or <a title=\"Melville\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herman_Melville\">Melville</a>. That’s why they call it, the dummy copy. This, of course, is not the real copy for this entry. Rest assured, the words will expand the concept. With clarity. Conviction. And a little wit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Square Tiles</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"ids\":[5836,5828,5829,5834,5832],\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"post\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/caleb-george-316073-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5836\" class=\"wp-image-5836\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/syd-sujuaan-293256-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5828\" class=\"wp-image-5828\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/tom-mussak-108420-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5829\" class=\"wp-image-5829\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/nathan-anderson-316188-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5834\" class=\"wp-image-5834\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/clem-onojeghuo-111588-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5832\" class=\"wp-image-5832\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s competitive <a title=\"market environment\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Market_environment\">market environment</a>, the body copy of your entry must lead the reader through a series of <strong>disarmingly simple thoughts</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5830} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/annie-spratt-173413-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5830\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5831} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/ishan-seefromthesky-179744-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5831\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5833,\"className\":\"size-full wp-image-5833\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image size-full wp-image-5833\"><figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img src=\"https://demo.wpzoom.com/inspiro-lite-blocks/files/2014/08/fidelia-zheng-106777-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5833\"/><figcaption>Full-width image</figcaption></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', 'Post with Gallery', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2831-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-10-31 10:28:29', '2019-10-31 10:28:29', '', 2831, 'http://localhost/aa/?p=6718', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
