equipo de profesionales en diferentes áreas propias del sector aeronáutico, turístico y de comercio exterior, que ofrece servicios para el desarrollo de actividades aeronáuticas tanto en talento humano como en gestión para la certificación de organizaciones aeronáuticas y afines, además de la comercialización de productos, importación y exportación de bienes y servicios y promoción turística a nivel nacional e internacional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":7101,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Jose-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7101\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center\">MISIÓN</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\">Promover la comercialización de diferentes productos, bienes y servicios en el mercado nacional e internacional, respondiendo a las necesidades del sector comercial, industrial, aeronáutico y turístico, prestando un excelente servicio de calidad con eficiencia y responsabilidad.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":7112,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Quienes-Somos-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7112\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">VISIÓN</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\">Ser una organización consolidada, reconocida a nivel nacional e internacional por su calidad en los servicios que presta, acorde con nuestros valores corporativos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e5e9ec\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e5e9ec\"><!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h1 style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">NUESTROS VALORES CORPORATIVOS</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\"><strong>Calidad:</strong>&nbsp;Somos un equipo de trabajo competente en la solución de necesidades propias del sector aeronáutico, turístico y de comercio internacional, garantizando la excelencia en nuestros servicios.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\"><strong>Eficiencia:</strong>&nbsp;Tenemos la capacidad, el conocimiento y las destrezas para realizar y cumplir las expectativas que ofrecemos en nuestros servicios.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\"><strong>Respeto:</strong>&nbsp;Tenemos la disponibilidad, la dignidad y el criterio para atender todas sus inquietudes, fomentando la tolerancia y el acompañamiento necesario para responder a sus necesidades.<strong></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify\"><strong>Responsabilidad:</strong>&nbsp;Somos una empresa que lleva a cabo procedimientos de reflexión, coordinación, administración y orientación, para garantizar el cumplimiento y la satisfacción en todos nuestros servicios.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":7106,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Anakarina-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7106\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"useFeaturedImage\":true,\"hasParallax\":true,\"dimRatio\":50,\"overlayColor\":\"black\",\"minHeight\":316,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"50px\",\"right\":\"50px\",\"bottom\":\"50px\",\"left\":\"50px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull has-parallax\" style=\"padding-top:50px;padding-right:50px;padding-bottom:50px;padding-left:50px;min-height:316px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-black-background-color has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"white\",\"width\":50,\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/aa/contactenos/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>CONTÁCTENOS</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->', 'Acerca de Nosotros', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5592-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-03-23 03:13:28', '2023-03-23 08:13:28', '', 5592, 'http://localhost/aa/?p=7479', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(7480, 1, '2023-03-23 03:16:40', '2023-03-23 08:16:40', '<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"100%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"57px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:57px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">AEROALLIANCE SAS</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Compañía dedicada a la prestación de servicios aeronáuticos, negocios internacionales y servicios turísticos a nivel nacional e internacional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/aa/about/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>Acerca de ...</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"55px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:55px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e5e9ec\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e5e9ec\"><!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">QUIENES SOMOS</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Somos un equipo de profesionales en diferentes áreas propias del sector Aeronáutico y Comercio Exterior, que ofrece servicios de Comercialización de Productos, Importación y Exportación de Bienes y Servicios y Promoción Turística a nivel Nacional e Internacional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/aa/about/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>ver mas</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6762,\"width\":503,\"height\":197,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Quienes-Somos-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6762\" width=\"503\" height=\"197\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center\">NUESTROS SERVICIOS</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6764,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Servicios-Aeronauticos.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6764\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">SERVICIOS AERONÁUTICOS</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nuestra empresa cuenta con un equipo de profesionales en diferentes áreas del sector aeronáutico así como alianzas estrátegicas con empresas nacionales e internacionales para ofrecer servicios en el desarrrollo de actividades aeronáuticas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/aa/servicios-aeronauticos/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>ver mas</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e5e9ec\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e5e9ec\"><!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">SERVICIOS TURÍSTICOS</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Prestamos servicios turísticos en sinergia con aerolíneas, hoteles y operadores de la mejor calidad a todo destino Nacional e Internacional.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"//localhost/aa/agencia-de-viajes/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>ver mas</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6760,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Servicios-Turisticos.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6760\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6767,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Negocios-Internacionales.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6767\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"1px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">NEGOCIOS INTERNACIONALES</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"45px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Está constituida por un conjunto de alianzas estratégicas con empresas nacionales e internacionales de alta calidad y experiencia, que permiten la prestación de un servicio integral en negocios internacionales y comercio exterior gara