(7725, 1, '2023-03-28 20:02:36', '2023-03-29 01:02:36', '<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Prestamos servicios turísticos en sinergia con aerolíneas, hoteles y operadores de la mejor calidad a todo destino Nacional e Internacional.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e5e9ec\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e5e9ec\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\">Dentro de nuestros servicios turísticos ofrecemos</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Transporte Aéreo</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Venta de tiquetes aéreos a destinos nacionales e internacionales, en alianza con las mejores aerolíneas y a los mejores precios. Además ofrecemos vuelos charter y de carga nacional e internacional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Al adquirir sus tiquetes aéreos con nosotros no solo asegura su viaje, sino que adquiere toda nuestra experiencia y soporte desde el asesoramiento para que viaje en las fechas donde le salga más económio, hasta el caso en que requiera realizar cambios o cualquier trámite ante las aerolíneas, sin tener que esperar tiempos extensos en línea. Además nos encargamos de realizar su web check_in y diligenciar todos los formularios necesarios para su viaje sin costo adicional. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-small-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/aa/aeroalliancetravels/\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>COMPRAR</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-bottom\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":7677,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Avion4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7677\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"30px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-small-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#Cotizar\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>COTIZAR</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":6882,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Air-New-Zeland.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6882\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6887,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Copa-Airlines.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6887\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6890,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Avianca.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6890\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6891,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Lufthansa.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6891\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6898,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Latam.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6898\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6899,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Volaris.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6899\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[smartslider3 slider=\"2\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":7671,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Crucero3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7671\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"86px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:86px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Transporte Marítimo</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Las mejores experiencias a bordo de los cruceros marítimos y fluviales más espectaculares del mundo en alianza con las mejores navieras, tales como Carnival, Royal Caribbean International, Norwegian, Pullmantur, MSC Cruceros, entre otros quienes colocan a su disposición grandes embarcaciones siguiendo todas las normas internacionales de seguridad y confort. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Somos especialistas en cruceros le garantizamos el mejor precio en más de 22 Navieras. Con nosotros recibe atención personalizada para planear sus próximas vacaciones solo, en familia o con amigos y podrá elegir entre una gran variedad de camarotes, interiores, con vista al mar, balcones o si lo prefiere Suites, y elegir alguno de los numerosos destinos que merecen la pena conocer, con planes todo icluido, con Tiquetes Aéreos, hospedajes, Crucero, Actividades a bordo y Asistencia al Viajero.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cualquiera que sea el destino, tenga por seguro que va a divertirse. Que está esperando! Embárquese con AEROALLIANCE TRAVELS!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"43px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:43px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-small-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#Cotizar\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"><strong>COTIZAR</strong></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":6885,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/aa/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Cruceros.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6885\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":7689,\"sizeSlug\":\"larg